    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your foe’s blade bisects your face diagonally, removing the major part of your nose as well as chunks of lip and part of one eyelid, leaving you horribly disfigured.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (3) and @Condition[Prone]. Also lose your nose – @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.SpPRZZRHxly7uo2G]{Amputation (Challenging)}, except a Gilded Nose cannot reduce the resulting Fellowship Characteristic loss as the scarring is too extensive.</p>"
